IMPORT prelude

-- The explorer's X2: a start the explorer cannot read as a number or a date
-- (here `1 / 0`, which has no value) is refused, not taken for 0.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF P
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF a

GIVETH A DEONTIC Person Action
unreadable MEANS PARTY P MUST a WITHIN 3 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY P

#TRACE unreadable AT (1 / 0) WITH
